OL,3,GNEWSANew #23m police station without
OL,4,Acustody suite 'waste' of time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new #23m police station
OL,7,Fwithout a custody suite near a city are
OL,8,Fa "waste of police time and public
OL,9,Fmoney", councillors have said.
OL,11,FWiltshire Police and Crime Commissioner
OL,12,F(PCC) Philip Wilkinson has defended the
OL,13,Fproposal for the Southern Policing Hub
OL,14,Fin Old Sarum, north of Salisbury, in an
OL,15,Fopen letter.
OL,17,FCouncillor Paul Sample said: "Every
OL,18,Fhour an officer spends transporting and
OL,19,Fsupervising a detainee outside South
OL,20,FWiltshire is an hour in which that
OL,21,Fofficer is unavailable to respond to
OL,22,Fanother incident."
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
