OL,3,GNEWSANew #23m police station without
OL,4,Acustody suite 'waste' of time
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilkinson says the force "simply cannot
OL,7,Fafford" it, but added: "We are buying
OL,8,Fsix acres, which does give us enough
OL,9,Fspace to have a custody suite should
OL,10,Four funding formula change."
